#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:10002
#: d72158a471644c56ab0fff0ed2d4555f
msgid "Correlation Analysis: Statistical Methods"
msgstr "相関解析: 統計的手法"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:10004
#: 6010fcbd30ff466d82962c8644d63c46
msgid ""
"gwexpy makes it easy to calculate statistical correlations between "
"TimeSeries objects. This is useful for noise hunting and investigating "
"nonlinear coupling."
msgstr ""
"gwexpyでは、TimeSeriesオブジェクト間の統計的相関を簡単に計算できます。これはノイズハンティングや非線形結合の調査に役立ちます。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:10006
#: 609dccec917448a182f749eb23003507
msgid "Supported methods:"
msgstr "サポートされている手法:"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:10007
#: d84050467631460591f00d201b8a256e
msgid "**Pearson (PCC)**: Linear correlation."
msgstr "**Pearson (PCC)**: 線形相関。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:10008
#: 531e42f7c5d649a19c6f7c3fda9dd1f0
msgid ""
"**Kendall (Ktau)**: Rank correlation (robust to outliers, non-parametric)."
msgstr "**Kendall (Ktau)**: 順位相関（外れ値に強く、ノンパラメトリック）。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:10009
#: c82bfb52e83444c0a794e69158357828
msgid ""
"**MIC**: Maximal Information Coefficient (robust to nonlinear relationships,"
" requires `minepy` via `python scripts/install_minepy.py`)."
msgstr ""
"**MIC**: Maximal Information Coefficient（非線形関係に対してロバスト、`minepy`が必要、`python "
"scripts/install_minepy.py`で構築）。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:30002
#: 7ca56ea0449a49b186f40cb5213ea143
msgid "Pairwise Correlation"
msgstr "ペアごとの相関"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:60002
#: ec64136c686d43fc8e4123f7c96f9369
msgid ""
"**Note — automatic resampling**: If two time series have different sample "
"rates, gwexpy will automatically resample one to match the other and emit a "
"`UserWarning`. To suppress this, ensure both series share the same sample "
"rate before calling correlation methods."
msgstr ""
"**注 — 自動リサンプリング**: 2 つの時系列のサンプルレートが異なる場合、gwexpy "
"は一方をもう一方に合わせて自動的にリサンプリングし、`UserWarning` "
"を出力します。これを抑制するには、相関メソッドを呼ぶ前に両系列のサンプルレートを揃えてください。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:90002
#: 1892d56bd63f46b085c76a4c0ce7b730
msgid "Correlation Vector (Noise Hunting)"
msgstr "相関ベクトル (ノイズハンティング)"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:90004
#: 2fe8a908954a4acbab377e973eff974e
msgid ""
"When investigating noise sources, we often want to check correlations "
"between a target channel (e.g., DARM) and hundreds of auxiliary channels. "
"`TimeSeriesMatrix.correlation_vector` efficiently computes this ranking."
msgstr ""
"ノイズ源を調査する際、ターゲットチャンネル（例：DARM）と数百の補助チャンネルとの間の相関を確認したいことがよくあります。 "
"`TimeSeriesMatrix.correlation_vector` はこのランキングを効率的に計算します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:140002
#: 2a07cba65b254f39912af3a30472c5c7
msgid "Partial Correlation (Confound Control)"
msgstr "偏相関（共通要因の除去）"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:140004
#: 4ea53d754c7a489e85b3e402333a62ac
msgid ""
"Partial correlation estimates direct coupling by removing shared confounds."
msgstr "共通の要因を取り除いて、直接的な結びつきを評価します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:160002
#: 1bb95aa9a86c4578a59c5fdde3b46784
msgid "Association Edges and Graphs"
msgstr "Association Edges / グラフ化"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:160004
#: a75372cf62254476ab778c7843190037
msgid "Use a target TimeSeries against a TimeSeriesMatrix to build edges."
msgstr "ターゲット時系列に対して行列の各チャンネルを評価し、エッジを作成します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:180002
#: 777938855eb94c5399464acbef3f72fc
msgid "Visualization: Edge Ranking and Partial-Corr Heatmap"
msgstr "可視化: エッジランキングと偏相関ヒートマップ"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:200002
#: 873f5ef81abb4ad3aa00a03397f6accb
msgid "FastMI (Experimental)"
msgstr "FastMI（実験的）"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:200004
#: 70734862da184dff88f95b4b90c78ed0
msgid ""
"FastMI is a fast mutual-information (MI) estimator based on a copula "
"formulation (empirical CDF), a probit transform, and an FFT-based self-"
"consistent density estimate."
msgstr ""
"FastMI は、copula（経験CDF）+ probit 変換 + FFT ベースの self-consistent 密度推定を用いた相互情報量 "
"(MI) 推定です。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:200006
#: 0139548864864ff5823ee7000930f478
msgid ""
"API: `TimeSeries.fastmi(other, grid_size=..., quantile=..., eps=...)` or "
"`correlation(other, method=\"fastmi\")`"
msgstr ""
"API: `TimeSeries.fastmi(other, grid_size=..., quantile=..., eps=...)` または "
"`correlation(other, method=\"fastmi\")`"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:200007
#: 28f3cf31dbfd4f398d4fdb18f50573c7
msgid ""
"Output: MI in **nats** (>= 0). Larger means stronger dependence (linear or "
"nonlinear)."
msgstr "出力: MI（**nats**、0以上）。値が大きいほど依存が強い（線形/非線形を問わない）。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:200008
#: 246dca7358154c0d9d899f94fe2f5f27
msgid "Parameters:"
msgstr "パラメータ:"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:200009
#: cb5ff03783e1441fb45bed15a32777fa
msgid "`grid_size`: FFT grid resolution (trade-off: accuracy vs speed)."
msgstr "`grid_size`: FFT グリッド分解能（精度と速度のトレードオフ）。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:200010
#: e16984b4d5444e638877e4d7c34d5973
msgid "`quantile`: trims extreme probit tails for numerical stability."
msgstr "`quantile`: probit の極端な裾をトリムして安定化。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:200011
#: 86e5dc6b80cb4bd4a452bc18b703d69c
msgid "`eps`: floor for probabilities/densities to avoid `log(0)`."
msgstr "`eps`: `log(0)` 回避のための下限。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:220002
#: f54aab79c15848259bc607c461c68056
msgid "CAGMon-style Association Graph (Minimal)"
msgstr "CAGMon 風の Association Graph（最小実装）"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:220004
#: 7b67b3502d9842b3b6cc53c712a8b119
msgid "Use the edge list and optionally build a graph for visualization."
msgstr "エッジリストからグラフを作り、必要なら可視化します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:240002
#: a822b700dca3425291f7afb286dfa911
msgid "Advanced Statistics"
msgstr "高度な統計解析 (Advanced Statistics)"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:240004
#: 82f1d9f97af94d55816c12b0100e0dfa
msgid ""
"gwexpy provides advanced statistical capabilities not only for correlation "
"but also for examining data distribution shape and causality."
msgstr "gwexpyは、相関だけでなく、データの分布形状や因果関係を調べるための高度な統計機能も提供しています。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:240006
#: ea7a439f6f2c4f37b4831b3fd31d1f5e
msgid "**Skewness**: Asymmetry of the distribution."
msgstr "**Skewness (歪度)**: 分布の非対称性。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:240007
#: e01f4988211944c09c135d52c0e66c7c
msgid "**Kurtosis**: Heaviness of distribution tails (presence of outliers)."
msgstr "**Kurtosis (尖度)**: 分布の裾の重さ（外れ値の多さ）。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:240008
#: 13963540b9164d629faa0482f7418e52
msgid "**Distance Correlation (dCor)**: Measure of nonlinear dependency."
msgstr "**Distance Correlation (dCor)**: 非線形な依存関係の尺度。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:240009
#: 7aa64343e6f34efea21eb774e6c3ce33
msgid ""
"**Granger Causality**: Causality between time series (contribution to "
"prediction)."
msgstr "**Granger Causality**: 時系列間の因果関係（予測への寄与）。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:250002
#: 78784468b21141cbbae78a6e32e9f173
msgid "Detecting Non-Gaussian Noise (Skewness / Kurtosis)"
msgstr "非ガウス性ノイズの検出 (Skewness / Kurtosis)"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:270002
#: a720e8de1f7748629741a01224c0a5c4
msgid "Detecting Nonlinear Dependency (Distance Correlation)"
msgstr "非線形依存性の検出 (Distance Correlation)"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:270004
#: 08f08d0ddb084ab3afe1b8ada1b6c02d
msgid ""
"Let's examine the relationship between the sine wave data (`ts_c`) and "
"linear data (`ts_a`) using dCor. We can detect relationships that Pearson "
"correlation cannot capture."
msgstr ""
"先ほどの正弦波データ(`ts_c`)と線形データ(`ts_a`)の関係をdCorで見てみましょう。Pearson相関では捉えられなかった関係が検出できます。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:290002
#: 51800ffc3eea4e3e8bb9db43d3bc2099
msgid "Estimating Causality (Granger Causality)"
msgstr "因果関係の推定 (Granger Causality)"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:290004
#: 31b67b32266b465288d04be811351bf1
msgid ""
"Tests whether past values of one time series help predict future values of "
"another time series."
msgstr "ある時系列の過去の値が、別の時系列の未来の値を予測するのに役立つかどうかを検定します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:310002
#: de672e2f07f348de853aa73d1698ae8f
msgid "Fast Mutual Information (fastmi)"
msgstr "高速相互情報量推定 (fastmi)"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_correlation.ipynb:310004
#: e5a1fe0a11074cfcb819bda8cd4ad4b2
msgid ""
"`fastmi` is a fast mutual-information (MI) estimator based on a copula "
"formulation, a probit transform, and an FFT-based density estimate. It "
"captures complex nonlinear dependencies that Pearson correlation might miss."
msgstr ""
"`fastmi` は、コピュラ（Copula）定式化、プロビット（Probit）変換、およびFFTベースの密度推定に基づく高速な相互情報量（Mutual"
" Information）推定器です。Pearson相関が見逃す可能性のある複雑な非線形依存関係を捉えることができます。"
